s}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!S8fG60czzyznmHyN.GUrHLtuqnl4x3KHH"},{"_id":"hzLoXfk0XZ09nziz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneTwoActions.webp","name":"Terrifying Gaze","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> or <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p><hr /><p>A tenome can gaze at a creature within 30 feet by presenting one of its eyes. The target must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:21|options:inflicts:frightened,inflicts:paralyzed] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}. If the tenome uses 2 actions and presents both of its eyes, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} if it fails the save.</p>\n<p>A creature that successfully saves is temporarily immune for 24 hours.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["emotion","fear","incapacitation","mental","occult","visual"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!S8fG60czzyznmHyN.hzLoXfk0XZ09nziz"},{"_id":"iUGSF5wsY0hhEr0g","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.Tkd8sH4pwFIPzqTr"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Grab","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":